=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xihe1Iq.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mttOKJb.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1S9UjyX.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8U6EqW7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EY1Banv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ajOKaqG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📖 關於</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>注意：若在已建立的世界中加入此模組，v1.1 版本會清除您的物品，v1.2 已修復此問題</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Stackable Items 可修改任何物品的堆疊上限，您可以使用指令或設定檔來調整物品的堆疊數量。</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><br></span></span></p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fTAl0dw.gif\" alt=\"預覽1\" width=\"864\" height=\"488\"></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hlS8drD.gif\" alt=\"預覽2\" width=\"864\" height=\"488\"></span></p>\n</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n</table><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\">⚙️ 設定選項</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">探索並調整設定檔中的選項以滿足您的需求：</span></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Stackable-Items/wiki/Config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">通用與客戶端設定檔</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Stackable-Items/wiki/Commands#add-command\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">新增指令</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Stackable-Items/wiki/Commands#edit-command---list\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">編輯指令 - 清單</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Stackable-Items/wiki/Commands#edit-command---group\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">編輯指令 - 群組</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Stackable-Items/wiki/Commands#edit-command---maxdefault\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">編輯指令 - 預設上限</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Stackable-Items/wiki/Commands#client-command---counttype\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">客戶端指令 - 計數類型</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Stackable-Items/wiki/Commands#client-command---showhelditem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">客戶端指令 - 顯示手持物品</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Stackable-Items/wiki/Commands#remove-command\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">移除指令</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Stackable-Items/wiki/Commands#help-command\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">幫助指令</a></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>⚙️ 預設設定</strong></span></p><p>告示牌群組：</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/bkwyqSQ.png\" width=\"868\" height=\"36\"></p><p>船群組：</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/HSKeKt8.png\" width=\"684\" height=\"36\"></p><p>唱片群組：</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/q7ogTvF.png\" width=\"684\" height=\"36\"></p><p>界伏盒群組：</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/RLO1gff.png\" width=\"612\" height=\"36\"></p><p>床群組：</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/sk2GGE2.png\" width=\"576\" height=\"36\"></p><p>旗幟群組：</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/PUp1Dk0.png\" width=\"612\" height=\"36\"></p><p>旗幟圖案群組：</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/3pv3Js6.png\" width=\"360\" height=\"36\"></p><p>桶群組：</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/P13rW8E.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"36\"></p><p>礦車群組：</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/RPBA6ym.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"36\"></p><p>馬甲群組：</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/o4QksEN.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"36\"></p><p>藥水群組：</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/FDnx5dI.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"36\"></p><p>設定清單（個別可堆疊物品）：</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/MUhgLau.png\" width=\"576\" height=\"36\"></p><p>其他設定（物品可超過百萬，上限為 10 億）：</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/QzFSGlb.png\" width=\"216\" height=\"36\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\">❓ 常見問題</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>問：</strong> Stackable Items 是客戶端還是伺服器端模組？</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> <strong>答：</strong> 這是雙端模組，您需要在客戶端和伺服器端都安裝。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>問：</strong> 我可以將 Stackable Items 包含在我的模組包中嗎？</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> <strong>答：</strong> 可以！只需正確標示模組來源並將其列入相關專案中。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>問：</strong> 它是否與外部物品模組的堆疊上限相容？<br> <strong>答：</strong> 是的！您可以使用指令新增任何物品，原版和外部模組的物品都能運作；另一個例子是，如果您加入一個新增唱片或更多附魔的模組，群組類型會增加最大堆疊數量。</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br><strong>問：</strong> 如何使用指令？<br> <strong>答：</strong> 只有管理員才能使用指令，您可以前往開啟作弊的其他世界使用指令，設定檔將會全局生效。<br></span></p>",
